 "lean": "import LeanFM.Session.Syntax\n\n/-- Three devices watch a guinea pig cage while its owners are away, and each reports to the hub\n    until it is switched off: the Arduino reads the water bottle, the food bowl and the temperature\n    (Reading), the food dispenser says when it runs (Dispense), and the webcam reports how much the\n    guinea pigs move (Frame). The measurements ride in each event's payload; check_signal decides\n    the claims about them (book Section 5.6), and session_conform checks the order of the events. -/\nprotocol GuineaPigCage (Arduino, Dispenser, Webcam, Hub) {\n  parallel {\n    loop Readings {\n      choice {\n        Reading from Arduino to Hub;\n        continue Readings;\n      } or {\n        ArduinoOff from Arduino to Hub;\n      }\n    }\n  } and {\n    loop Feeding {\n      choice {\n        Dispense from Dispenser to Hub;\n        continue Feeding;\n      } or {\n        DispenserOff from Dispenser to Hub;\n      }\n    }\n  } and {\n    loop Watching {\n      choice {\n        Frame from Webcam to Hub;\n        continue Watching;\n      } or {\n        WebcamOff from Webcam to Hub;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n",
